# Anxiety Index brief: week ending 2026-10-31

*Issued 2026-11-04. Data through 2026-11-04.*

## 62 — Elevated, down 3.0 on the week

Up 9 points over four weeks. Attention is spread across many stories, so new ones find room.

**So far this week:** 59 (Elevated), -2.7 against the completed week. Provisional; it will move as the week's data arrive.

## What is driving it

| Dimension | Reading | Band | Change | Share of this week's anxiety |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Geopolitical | 92 | High | -1 | 43% |
| Cost of living | 75 | Elevated | -2 | 36% |
| Political and institutional | 71 | Elevated | +0 | 14% |
| Disasters, climate and health | 59 | Elevated | -7 | 4% |
